## Local run observed (Windows, LocalDB)

`pwsh ./scripts/local/Start-LocalDemo.ps1` created the local database, applied
the repository-owned migrations through the repository-local `dotnet-ef`, and
started the host on HTTPS loopback. Over HTTPS: the Development sign-in page
returned 200; the sign-in POST with its antiforgery token returned 302 to the
create-case page; the create-case page returned 200 with the session and 401
without it; a sign-in POST without an antiforgery token returned 400. No key or
connection value was printed.

